      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Keto-Slow-Cooker-Parmesan-Meatballs-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine and knead with your clean hands to mix all of the ingredients together well.",
