      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Keto-Slow-Cooker-Parmesan-Meatballs-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan, heat olive oil over medium heat. Add the meatballs in and cook until brown in color.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-parmesan-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-54633-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Keto-Slow-Cooker-Parmesan-Meatballs-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Put the cooked meatballs into the slow cooker. Mix together crushed tomatoes and tomato paste. , onion, and the bay leaf.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-parmesan-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-54633-step-0-5",
