    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add in olive oil and the zoodles. Cook until tender.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-slow-cooker-parmesan-meatballs/#wprm-recipe-54633-step-0-8",
